WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Fewer than one microbe in a hundred will grow in a dish. So we read the DNA of the whole community instead.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The goal sets the objective and loads a real dataset. It skips nothing.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Before any result, the lab shows what it is about to analyse — including the format read out of the bytes, not the extension.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The content is measured. A protein file declared as a genome is caught here, before any nucleotide QC could run on it.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Which quality control runs depends on what the file actually contains.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Four thousand reads, mean quality Q34, ninety-four percent at Q30. It passes.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Every analysis gets its own verdict. "Your data cannot support this" and "this build does not implement it" are different statements.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Thirty-seven percent archaea. In a digester the archaea are the methanogens, so this community really is making methane.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Click a phylum and you see the species inside it — here, the three methanogens that make up that thirty-seven percent.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:25.000
No gene was detected anywhere in this build. Function is inferred from which organisms were found, and the screen says so.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Hydrolysis, acidogenesis, acetogenesis, methanogenesis — and which organisms run each.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Now run the digester those microbes live in.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.000
About half a cubic metre per kilogram, at fifty-five percent methane.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Drop the pH and the methanogens stall. This is how a real digester dies.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:09.000
A tenth of the yield, and less methane in the gas. Note the label: this is a simulation, never a prediction.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Finish the Bioreactor step and the lab routes you to the assessment.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:28.000
Completing it offers the unlock. Taking it is your choice.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:33.000
Moderate is yours. Advanced is a separate paid tier, checked with the server.
